DEFINE
<a door named north door
<a key named brass key
<a guard named henry.

START
<north door is locked
<brass key is on the table
<henry is calm.

WHEN
<player takes brass key
<then> (carry brass key.

IF
<north door is locked
<then> (unlock north door.

WHEN
<player attacks henry
<then> (damage henry
<then> (change henry to angry.
